    "title": "吉林省高等学校毕业生就业指导中心学习贯彻习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想主题教育",
    "source": "人民网",
    "publishDate": "2023-05-04",
    "bodyHtml": "\n                        <p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><img alt=\"\" height=\"15\" src=\"assets/236413a1e5002810f6f9be856f85ac66b792ca3c44cd67c2a800ca2b1af99c93.png\" width=\"15\">​​<span style=\"background-color:rgba(220,220,220,0.5)\">​</span>​<a href=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/n1/2023/0331/c64094-32654859.html\"><span style=\"background-color:white\">中共中央政治局召开会议研究部署在全党深入开展学习贯彻习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想主题教育工作</span></a></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><img alt=\"\" height=\"15\" src=\"assets/236413a1e5002810f6f9be856f85ac66b792ca3c44cd67c2a800ca2b1af99c93.png\" width=\"15\">​​<span style=\"background-color:rgba(220,220,220,0.5)\">​</span>​</strong><a href=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/n1/2023/0320/c64387-32647367.html\"><strong><span style=\"background-color:white\">中共中央办公厅印发《关于在全党大兴调查研究的工作方案》</span></strong></a></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><a href=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/n1/2023/0401/c64094-32655693.html\"><strong><img alt=\"\" height=\"15\" src=\"assets/236413a1e5002810f6f9be856f85ac66b792ca3c44cd67c2a800ca2b1af99c93.png\" width=\"15\">​​<span style=\"background-color:rgba(220,220,220,0.5)\">​</span>​<span style=\"background-color:white\">习近平在中共中央政治局第四次集体学习时强调把学习贯彻新时代中国特色社会主义思想不断引向深入</span></strong></a></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><img alt=\"\" height=\"15\" src=\"assets/236413a1e5002810f6f9be856f85ac66b792ca3c44cd67c2a800ca2b1af99c93.png\" width=\"15\">​​<span style=\"background-color:rgba(220,220,220,0.5)\">​</span>​<a href=\"http://dangjian.people.com.cn/n1/2023/0403/c117092-32656435.html\">坚持不懈用习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想凝心铸魂（深入学习贯彻习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想）</a></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><img alt=\"\" height=\"15\" src=\"assets/236413a1e5002810f6f9be856f85ac66b792ca3c44cd67c2a800ca2b1af99c93.png\" width=\"15\">​​<span style=\"background-color:rgba(220,220,220,0.5)\">​</span>​<a href=\"http://ztjy.people.cn/n1/2023/0430/c457340-32676852.htm\">《求是》杂志发表习近平总书记重要文章《在学习贯彻习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想主题教育工作会议上的讲话》</a></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><img alt=\"\" height=\"15\" src=\"assets/236413a1e5002810f6f9be856f85ac66b792ca3c44cd67c2a800ca2b1af99c93.png\" width=\"15\">​​<span style=\"background-color:rgba(220,220,220,0.5)\">​</span>​<a href=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/n1/2023/0404/c64094-32657148.html\">扎实抓好主题教育&nbsp;&nbsp;为奋进新征程凝心聚力</a></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><img alt=\"\" height=\"15\" src=\"assets/236413a1e5002810f6f9be856f85ac66b792ca3c44cd67c2a800ca2b1af99c93.png\" width=\"15\">​​<span style=\"background-color:rgba(220,220,220,0.5)\">​</span>​<a href=\"http://ztjy.people.cn/n1/2023/0430/c457340-32676832.html\">在学习贯彻习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想主题教育工作会议上的讲话</a></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><img alt=\"\" height=\"15\" src=\"assets/236413a1e5002810f6f9be856f85ac66b792ca3c44cd67c2a800ca2b1af99c93.png\" width=\"15\">​​<span style=\"background-color:rgba(220,220,220,0.5)\">​</span>​</strong></span></span><a href=\"http://www.gov.cn/xinwen/2022-10/25/content_5721685.htm\"><span style=\"background-color:white\">必读：二十大报告</span></a></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><img alt=\"\" height=\"15\" src=\"assets/236413a1e5002810f6f9be856f85ac66b792ca3c44cd67c2a800ca2b1af99c93.png\" width=\"15\">​​<span style=\"background-color:rgba(220,220,220,0.5)\">​</span>​</strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span><a href=\"http://dangjian.people.com.cn/GB/136058/427510/428086/428087/index.html\"><span style=\"background-color:white\">必读：</span></a><a href=\"http://dangjian.people.com.cn/GB/136058/427510/428086/428087/index.html\"><span style=\"background-color:white\">《中国共产党党章（修正案）》</span></a></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><img alt=\"\" height=\"16\" src=\"assets/236413a1e5002810f6f9be856f85ac66b792ca3c44cd67c2a800ca2b1af99c93.png\" width=\"16\">​​<span style=\"background-color:rgba(220,220,220,0.5)\">​</span>​</strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong><a href=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/n1/2023/0405/c64387-32657893.html\"><strong><span style=\"background-color:white\">人民日报评论员文章：为奋进新征程凝心聚力——论学习贯彻习近平总书记在主题教育工作会议上重要讲话</span></strong></a></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><img alt=\"\" height=\"16\" src=\"assets/236413a1e5002810f6f9be856f85ac66b792ca3c44cd67c2a800ca2b1af99c93.png\" width=\"16\">​​<span style=\"background-color:rgba(220,220,220,0.5)\">​</span>​</strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong><a href=\"http://m.news.cn/2023-04/05/c_1129495065.htm\"><strong><span style=\"background-color:white\">新华社评论员文章：深刻认识开展主题教育的重大意义——一论扎实抓好学习贯彻习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想主题教育</span></strong></a></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><img alt=\"\" height=\"16\" src=\"assets/236413a1e5002810f6f9be856f85ac66b792ca3c44cd67c2a800ca2b1af99c93.png\" width=\"16\">​​<span style=\"background-color:rgba(220,220,220,0.5)\">​</span>​</strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong><a href=\"http://www.news.cn/politics/leaders/2023-04/05/c_1129497074.htm\"><strong><span style=\"background-color:white\">新华社评论员文章：牢牢把握主题教育的总要求——二论扎实抓好学习贯彻习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想主题教育</span></strong></a></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><img alt=\"\" height=\"16\" src=\"assets/236413a1e5002810f6f9be856f85ac66b792ca3c44cd67c2a800ca2b1af99c93.png\" width=\"16\">​​<span style=\"background-color:rgba(220,220,220,0.5)\">​</span>​</strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong><a href=\"http://www.news.cn/politics/leaders/2023-04/05/c_1129497074.htm\"><strong><span style=\"background-color:white\">新华社评论员文章：</span></strong></a><a href=\"http://m.news.cn/2023-04/07/c_1129500304.htm\"><strong><span style=\"background-color:white\">抓住根本任务，务求取得实效——三论扎实抓好学习贯彻习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想主题教育</span></strong></a></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><img alt=\"\" height=\"16\" src=\"assets/236413a1e5002810f6f9be856f85ac66b792ca3c44cd67c2a800ca2b1af99c93.png\" width=\"16\">​​<span style=\"background-color:rgba(220,220,220,0.5)\">​</span>​</strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></strong><a href=\"http://www.news.cn/politics/leaders/2023-04/05/c_1129497074.htm\"><strong><span style=\"background-color:white\">新华社评论员文章：</span></strong></a><a href=\"http://m.news.cn/2023-04/07/c_1129503604.htm\"><strong><span style=\"background-color:white\">在有机融合、一体推进中扎实开展主题教育——四论扎实抓好学习贯彻习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想主题教育</span></strong></a></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-s